@baseUrl = http://localhost:5098
@accessToken = replace-with-jwt

### 1. List embedded LiveKit VirtualRooms
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/virtual-rooms?includeInactive=true
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 2. Create VirtualRoom linked to Group auto-attendance
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/virtual-rooms
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Leadership Cohort Weekly Hybrid Room",
  "slug": "leadership-cohort-hybrid",
  "contextKind": "GroupMeeting",
  "maxParticipants": 120,
  "emptyTimeoutSeconds": 300,
  "autoRecordAttendance": true,
  "minimumAttendanceDwellSeconds": 180,
  "autoStartRecordingEgress": false
}

### 3. Get VirtualRoom by slug
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/virtual-rooms/leadership-cohort-hybrid
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 4. Update VirtualRoom
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/virtual-rooms/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Leadership Cohort Weekly Hybrid Room Updated",
  "slug": "leadership-cohort-hybrid",
  "contextKind": "GroupMeeting",
  "maxParticipants": 150,
  "emptyTimeoutSeconds": 300,
  "autoRecordAttendance": true,
  "minimumAttendanceDwellSeconds": 120
}

### 5. Create and start Live VirtualRoomSession
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/virtual-rooms/sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "virtualRoomId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "title": "Weekly Cohort Session",
  "scheduledStartUtc": "2026-11-26T17:00:00Z",
  "scheduledEndUtc": "2026-11-26T18:00:00Z",
  "startLiveNow": true
}

### 6. List VirtualRoomSessions
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/virtual-rooms/sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 7. Mint short-lived ACL-mapped HMAC-SHA256 LiveKit room JWT
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/virtual-rooms/leadership-cohort-hybrid/join-token
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomIdOrSlug": "leadership-cohort-hybrid",
  "displayName": "Jordan Taylor",
  "ttlMinutes": 30
}

### 8. Start RustFS S3 composite MP4 recording egress
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/virtual-rooms/sessions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002/recordings/start
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sessionId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002",
  "layout": "grid"
}

### 9. Stop active recording egress
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/virtual-rooms/sessions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002/recordings/stop
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sessionId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002",
  "egressId": "EG_sample"
}

### 10. List archived RustFS S3 recordings
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/virtual-rooms/recordings
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 11. Close VirtualRoomSession
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/virtual-rooms/sessions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002/close
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 12. LiveKit Webhook ingest (expects valid HMAC-SHA256 + SHA-256 Authorization JWT; returns 401 when unsigned)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/virtual-rooms/webhooks/livekit
Authorization: Bearer invalid-webhook-jwt
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "event": "participant_joined",
  "createdAt": 1795700000,
  "room": { "name": "ruth-leadership-cohort-hybrid-00000000", "sid": "RM_123" },
  "participant": { "identity": "person:00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003", "name": "Jordan Taylor" }
}
